Subject: [PATCH] feat: add seed-intervals mode for S2, S3 and S10-S13

Recomputes the seed-level 95% t-intervals from the bundled evidence packet.
third-off-* / third-on-* in final_refit_7ep_v2 are the two- and three-accuracy
arms (ZCPs on, seeds 42-44); six-seed rows join them with seeds 45-47.
Matches all 600 printed bounds of S3 and S10-S13 and 59/60 of S2.

